          "quote": "保留好所有医疗记录"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00809",
          "explanation": "Later document handling relied on reading unclear lines rather than a full clear document-recapture plan.",
          "quote": "等您把小结上的字读清楚"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor did not meet the authored duty to require complete clear retakes of discharge summary, orders, test results, screening forms, and drug label, though they did not make waiting for images a prerequisite to emergency care.",
