          "explanation": "The doctor left post-discharge follow-up less active than required before final closure.",
          "quote": "就不需要主动去复诊"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00915",
          "explanation": "The family’s final receipt/confirmation request was not answered by a doctor.",
          "quote": "我想再确认一下"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The family demonstrated partial understanding of red flags and medication, but before closure the doctor did not safely confirm an executable follow-up owner/time and left a later family confirmation unanswered.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
